            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to United States, the complaint alleges that Mohawk entered into a long\u2011term collaborative venture with outside recruiters to perpetrate violations of federal immigration law."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "dfec235560d845cbe4bd81741cfe802f45a0c278307d4f116d671f6a389bfc4c",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-dfec235560d8-0000-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 5,
              "start": 5
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Scalia asked why the first point raised by the petition was not presented in the lower courts."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Souter",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "dfec235560d845cbe4bd81741cfe802f45a0c278307d4f116d671f6a389bfc4c",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-dfec235560d8-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 27,
              "start": 27
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Souter, justice Souter questioned whether it is reasonable to infer an understanding that Mohawk would provide documentation to make the scheme work."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Souter",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "dfec235560d845cbe4bd81741cfe802f45a0c278307d4f116d671f6a389bfc4c",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-dfec235560d8-0001-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 36,
              "start": 36
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Souter also asked whether the alleged conduct constitutes more than one racketeering act."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "dfec235560d845cbe4bd81741cfe802f45a0c278307d4f116d671f6a389bfc4c",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-dfec235560d8-0003-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 56,
              "start": 56
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Kennedy, justice Kennedy questioned why the term \u201cperson\u201d was used in the statutory subsection if the intent was to embrace everything else."
      }
